{"title":"1903.01672 Causal Discovery from Heterogeneous/Nonstationary Data with Independent Changes","markdown":{"headingText":"1903.01672 Causal Discovery from Heterogeneous/Nonstationary Data with Independent Changes","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Biwei Huang, Kun Zhang, Jiji Zhang, Joseph Ramsey, Ruben Sanchez-Romero, Clark Glymour, Bernhard Schölkopf / 2019-03 (v5: 2020, JMLR 21:1–53) / arXiv:1903.01672\n- **一句话定位**：提出 CD-NOD 框架，把跨域/时变的分布偏移（distribution shift）作为因果发现的资源：用代理变量 C（域或时间指标）恢复因果骨架、利用\"因果模块独立变化\"原理定向，并提取非平稳性的低维\"驱动力\"表示。\n- **研究问题**：异质/非平稳数据的生成机制随域或时间变化，直接套用固定因果模型的约束法（PC/FCI）会产生伪边（相关变化形同隐藏混杂），功能因果模型（如 LiNGAM）在合并数据上残差不再独立。如何反而利用分布变化识别哪些机制在变、骨架、方向，并刻画变化本身？\n- **模型与方法**：SEM 为 V_i = f_i(PA_i, g_i(C), θ_i(C), ε_i)，其中 C 为域/时间指标，θ_i(C) 是随 C 变化的机制参数，g_i(C) 为\"伪混杂（pseudo confounder）\"——可写成 C 的（光滑）函数。假设 1（伪因果充分性）、假设 2（增广图 G^aug 上的 Markov 与忠实性）。Phase I（Algorithm 1）：在 V∪C 上做（核条件独立 KCI）检验，与 C 相邻的变量即机制变化者，且给定 C 后 V 内条件独立关系与真实因果结构一致。Phase II 定向：情形 S1 用含 C 的无盾三元组（不变性的推广：P(V_i|S) 不变 ⟺ V_i⊥⊥C|S，涵盖 Hoover/Tian–Pearl/ICP 类方法）；情形 S2（两端都随 C 变）用独立变化原理——无混杂时 P(cause) 与 P(effect|cause)（即 θ_i(C) 与 θ_j(C)）独立变化，而反向分解 P(V₂)与P(V₁|V₂) 的变化参数一般相依；通过构造虚拟联合分布 P̃(Y,X|C=c)=P(Y|X,C=c)P(X) 的核嵌入（Proposition 1 给出免滑动窗口的全数据估计）与扩展 HSIC 度量模块间依赖来定向。KNV：对条件分布嵌入的 Gram 矩阵做特征值分解，得到非平稳\"驱动力\"的低维可视化，同样不依赖窗口分割。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Theorem 1：在假设 1、2 下，V_i 与 V_j 在 G 中不相邻 ⟺ 给定 {其余变量}∪{C} 的某子集条件独立（骨架渐近可恢复，如同隐藏变化因子已知）。Theorem 2：相邻变量对的方向可识别，若满足其一：(1) 该边参与 V 结构；(2) 至少一方机制变化（双方都变则需独立变化）；(3) 存在只邻接其中一方的第三条边。Corollary 1 给出全图可识别的相应条件。实验：合成数据、star/plus 任务 fMRI（25 个 ROI，500 ms 分辨率，恢复的方向与已知视觉/运动通路一致）、港股与美股数据（驱动力与市场事件对应），并与 PC、LiNGAM 等基线比较占优。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：把\"独立因果机制（independent causal mechanisms）\"原则从静态的可检验性困境中解放出来——模块独立只有在变化中方可在有限样本中检验；论证非平稳性/异质性等价于一类软干预（soft intervention），是\"分布偏移携带因果信息\"这一路线（ICP、多域因果发现）的集大成与非线性、非参数化推广。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1903.01672.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution-bibtex":"BibTeX